        "liquid_iMeppt": {
          "type": "liquid",
          "settings": {
            "liquid": "<!-- EquilibraMeno — Bloc FAQ / Une question (custom liquid) -->\n<div class=\"eqm-faq\">\n  <h2 class=\"eqm-faq__title\">¿Alguna pregunta?</h2>\n\n  <div class=\"eqm-faq__list\">\n    <div class=\"eqm-faq__item\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"eqm-faq__q\">\n        <span>¿Al cabo de cuánto tiempo veré resultados?</span>\n        <span class=\"eqm-faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span>\n      </button>\n      <div class=\"eqm-faq__a\">\n        <p>Los primeros cambios suelen notarse a partir de las 2-3 semanas. Se recomienda una cura de 3 meses para resultados óptimos.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"eqm-faq__item\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"eqm-faq__q\">\n        <span>¿La fórmula es realmente natural y sin hormonas?</span>\n        <span class=\"eqm-faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span>\n      </button>\n      <div class=\"eqm-faq__a\">\n        <p>Sí, la fórmula se basa en magnesio liposomal, actea de racimo negro y vitamina B6, sin hormonas de síntesis.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"eqm-faq__item\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"eqm-faq__q\">\n        <span>¿Es adecuado si he ganado peso solo en la zona del vientre?</span>\n        <span class=\"eqm-faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span>\n      </button>\n      <div class=\"eqm-faq__a\">\n        <p>Sí. Durante la menopausia, la caída de estrógenos favorece la acumulación de grasa abdominal. La fórmula ayuda a sostener el metabolismo en esta zona.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"eqm-faq__item\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"eqm-faq__q\">\n        <span>¿Hay contraindicaciones?</span>\n        <span class=\"eqm-faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span>\n      </button>\n      <div class=\"eqm-faq__a\">\n        <p>EquilibraMeno no contiene hormonas. Si estás en tratamiento médico, embarazada o en lactancia, consulta a tu médico antes de tomarlo.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"eqm-faq__item\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"eqm-faq__q\">\n        <span>¿Puedo tomarlo todo el año?</span>\n        <span class=\"eqm-faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span>\n      </button>\n      <div class=\"eqm-faq__a\">\n        <p>Sí, puede tomarse de forma continuada mientras persistan los síntomas relacionados con la menopausia.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .eqm-faq {\n    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important;\n    max-width: 720px !important;\n    margin: 48px auto !important;\n    padding: 0 20px !important;\n  }\n  .eqm-faq__title {\n    font-weight: 700 !important;\n    color: #5c1730 !important;\n    font-size: 28px !important;\n    text-align: center !important;\n    margin: 0 0 28px 0 !important;\n  }\n  .eqm-faq__list {\n    display: block !important;\n  }\n  .eqm-faq__item {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #eee1e6 !important;\n  }\n  .eqm-faq__q {\n    width: 100% !important;\n    display: flex !important;\n    align-items: center !important;\n    justify-content: space-between !important;\n    gap: 12px !important;\n    background: none !important;\n    border: none !important;\n    text-align: left !important;\n    padding: 16px 4px !important;\n    cursor: pointer !important;\n    font-family: inherit !important;\n    font-size: 15px !important;\n    font-weight: 600 !important;\n    color: #2b1620 !important;\n  }\n  .eqm-faq__icon {\n    flex-shrink: 0 !important;\n    font-size: 18px !important;\n    font-weight: 400 !important;\n    color: #7a1f3d !important;\n    transition: transform .2s ease !important;\n  }\n  .eqm-faq__item.is-open .eqm-faq__icon {\n    transform: rotate(45deg) !important;\n  }\n  .eqm-faq__a {\n    max-height: 0 !important;\n    overflow: hidden !important;\n    transition: max-height .2s ease !important;\n  }\n  .eqm-faq__a p {\n    margin: 0 !important;\n    padding: 0 4px 16px !important;\n    font-size: 14px !important;\n    line-height: 1.5 !important;\n    color: #7a6a70 !important;\n  }\n  .eqm-faq__item.is-open .eqm-faq__a {\n    max-height: 400px !important;\n  }\n</style>\n\n<script>\n(function() {\n  document.querySelectorAll('.eqm-faq').forEach(function(faq) {\n    if (faq.dataset.eqmFaqInit === '1') return;\n    faq.dataset.eqmFaqInit = '1';\n    var items = faq.querySelectorAll('.eqm-faq__item');\n    items.forEach(function(item) {\n      var q = item.querySelector('.eqm-faq__q');\n      if (!q) return;\n      q.addEventListener('click', function() {\n        var wasOpen = item.classList.contains('is-open');\n        items.forEach(function(i) { i.classList.remove('is-open'); });\n        if (!wasOpen) { item.classList.add('is-open'); }\n      });\n    });\n  });\n})();\n</script>"
