        "liquid": "<!-- EquilibraMeno — FAQ \"Respuestas a tus preguntas\" (custom liquid) -->\n<div class=\"eqm-faq3\">\n  <h2 class=\"eqm-faq3__title\">Respuestas a tus preguntas</h2>\n\n  <div class=\"eqm-faq3__list\">\n\n    <div class=\"eqm-faq3__item\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"eqm-faq3__q\">\n        <span>¿Cuándo empezaré a notar los primeros efectos?</span>\n        <span class=\"eqm-faq3__toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8250;</span>\n      </button>\n      <div class=\"eqm-faq3__a\">\n        <p>La mayoría de nuestras clientas observan mejoras desde los primeros 10 días, con efectos óptimos tras 3 meses de uso regular.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"eqm-faq3__item\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"eqm-faq3__q\">\n        <span>¿Puedo tomarlo si estoy en premenopausia?</span>\n        <span class=\"eqm-faq3__toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8250;</span>\n      </button>\n      <div class=\"eqm-faq3__a\">\n        <p>Sí, este complemento también es adecuado para la premenopausia y ayuda a regular los primeros desequilibrios hormonales.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"eqm-faq3__item\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"eqm-faq3__q\">\n        <span>¿Es compatible con otros tratamientos?</span>\n        <span class=\"eqm-faq3__toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8250;</span>\n      </button>\n      <div class=\"eqm-faq3__a\">\n        <p>Este complemento puede tomarse junto con la mayoría de los tratamientos. Aun así, te recomendamos consultar a tu médico en caso de duda, especialmente si sigues un tratamiento hormonal sustitutivo (THS).</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"eqm-faq3__item\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"eqm-faq3__q\">\n        <span>¿Puedo tomarlo con un anticonceptivo?</span>\n        <span class=\"eqm-faq3__toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8250;</span>\n      </button>\n      <div class=\"eqm-faq3__a\">\n        <p>Sí, este complemento es compatible con los anticonceptivos hormonales.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"eqm-faq3__item\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"eqm-faq3__q\">\n        <span>¿Ayuda a reducir la sequedad vaginal?</span>\n        <span class=\"eqm-faq3__toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8250;</span>\n      </button>\n      <div class=\"eqm-faq3__a\">\n        <p>Gracias a la actea de racimo negro y al magnesio, este complemento puede ayudar a aliviar la sequedad vaginal, actuando sobre el equilibrio hormonal general.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"eqm-faq3__item\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"eqm-faq3__q\">\n        <span>¿Es eficaz para mejorar la libido?</span>\n        <span class=\"eqm-faq3__toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8250;</span>\n      </button>\n      <div class=\"eqm-faq3__a\">\n        <p>Sí, este complemento favorece la libido al actuar sobre el equilibrio hormonal y emocional.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"eqm-faq3__item\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"eqm-faq3__q\">\n        <span>¿Debo empezar en un momento específico?</span>\n        <span class=\"eqm-faq3__toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8250;</span>\n      </button>\n      <div class=\"eqm-faq3__a\">\n        <p>No, puedes empezar en cualquier momento, ya que este complemento no contiene hormonas.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"eqm-faq3__item\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"eqm-faq3__q\">\n        <span>¿Cuánto tiempo debo tomarlo?</span>\n        <span class=\"eqm-faq3__toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8250;</span>\n      </button>\n      <div class=\"eqm-faq3__a\">\n        <p>Para resultados duraderos, recomendamos una cura mínima de 3 a 6 meses.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"eqm-faq3__item\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"eqm-faq3__q\">\n        <span>¿Qué precauciones debo tener?</span>\n        <span class=\"eqm-faq3__toggle\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8250;</span>\n      </button>\n      <div class=\"eqm-faq3__a\">\n        <p>Este complemento no está recomendado para mujeres embarazadas o en lactancia. Consulta a un profesional de la salud si sigues un tratamiento específico o tienes alguna condición médica.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .eqm-faq3 {\n    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif !important;\n    max-width: 720px !important;\n    margin: 40px auto !important;\n    padding: 0 20px !important;\n  }\n  .eqm-faq3__title {\n    font-weight: 700 !important;\n    color: #2b1620 !important;\n    font-size: 26px !important;\n    text-align: center !important;\n    margin: 0 0 24px 0 !important;\n  }\n  .eqm-faq3__list {\n    background: #f4f4f4 !important;\n    border-radius: 18px !important;\n    padding: 6px 24px !important;\n  }\n  .eqm-faq3__item {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e2e2 !important;\n  }\n  .eqm-faq3__item:last-child {\n    border-bottom: none !important;\n  }\n  .eqm-faq3__q {\n    width: 100% !important;\n    display: flex !important;\n    align-items: center !important;\n    justify-content: space-between !important;\n    gap: 16px !important;\n    background: none !important;\n    border: none !important;\n    text-align: left !important;\n    padding: 18px 0 !important;\n    cursor: pointer !important;\n    font-family: inherit !important;\n    font-size: 15px !important;\n    font-weight: 700 !important;\n    color: #1a1a1a !important;\n  }\n  .eqm-faq3__toggle {\n    flex-shrink: 0 !important;\n    width: 28px !important;\n    height: 28px !important;\n    min-width: 28px !important;\n    min-height: 28px !important;\n    border-radius: 50% !important;\n    background: #1a1a1a !important;\n    color: #ffffff !important;\n    display: flex !important;\n    align-items: center !important;\n    justify-content: center !important;\n    font-size: 16px !important;\n    line-height: 1 !important;\n    transition: transform .2s ease !important;\n  }\n  .eqm-faq3__item.is-open .eqm-faq3__toggle {\n    transform: rotate(90deg) !important;\n  }\n  .eqm-faq3__a {\n    max-height: 0 !important;\n    overflow: hidden !important;\n    transition: max-height .25s ease !important;\n  }\n  .eqm-faq3__a p {\n    margin: 0 !important;\n    padding: 0 0 20px !important;\n    font-size: 14px !important;\n    line-height: 1.55 !important;\n    color: #4a4a4a !important;\n  }\n  .eqm-faq3__item.is-open .eqm-faq3__a {\n    max-height: 400px !important;\n  }\n</style>\n\n<script>\n(function() {\n  document.querySelectorAll('.eqm-faq3').forEach(function(faq) {\n    if (faq.dataset.eqmFaq3Init === '1') return;\n    faq.dataset.eqmFaq3Init = '1';\n    var items = faq.querySelectorAll('.eqm-faq3__item');\n    items.forEach(function(item) {\n      var q = item.querySelector('.eqm-faq3__q');\n      if (!q) return;\n      q.addEventListener('click', function() {\n        var wasOpen = item.classList.contains('is-open');\n        items.forEach(function(i) { i.classList.remove('is-open'); });\n        if (!wasOpen) { item.classList.add('is-open'); }\n      });\n    });\n  });\n})();\n</script>",
